WEBVTT

1
00:00:02.636 --> 00:00:14.845
Paper trading with ₹10,00,000 of virtual cash. Buy asks you to log in first.

2
00:00:14.845 --> 00:00:17.469
Back on the stock with the ticket open. The chart stays in view beside it.

3
00:00:17.469 --> 00:00:21.836
Delivery or Intraday; Market or Limit. Market fills at the live price.

4
00:00:21.836 --> 00:00:26.968
The required amount and available cash update as you type.

5
00:00:26.968 --> 00:00:32.169
A review step before anything is sent.

6
00:00:32.169 --> 00:00:42.437
Executed at the market price, with a link to the order book.

7
00:00:42.437 --> 00:00:49.791
A limit order: type a price, or pick one from the market depth.

8
00:00:49.791 --> 00:01:00.291
Market rules: prices must sit inside the ±20% circuit band, on a 5-paise tick.

9
00:01:00.291 --> 00:01:03.150
Below the market, so it rests on the book until the price comes down.
